    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1534819818": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 482049571,
   "actor": "Celeste",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "People don’t always need a reason to do something. Sometimes, they do it simply because they can. Just like me.",
   "jump": {
    "mode": "Jump",
    "to": "rooty"
   },
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-808974659": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1096413607,
   "actor": "Celeste",
   "expression": 3,
   "expressionName": "Sad",
   "text": "I don’t remember.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "613333691": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1096413607,
   "actor": "Celeste",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I recall a life before this one… but it was someone else’s. Another girl, another existence. And then, one day…",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1919011175": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1096413607,
   "actor": "Celeste",
   "expression": 2,
   "expressionName": "Angry",
   "text": "She died.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-2001385464": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1096413607,
   "actor": "Celeste",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "And in her place, I was born. That is all that matters.",
   "jump": {
    "mode": "Jump",
    "to": "rooty"
   },
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1921739270": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -2114862856,
   "actor": "Celeste",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "To stay where you belong. Beneath me.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-534149916": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -2114862856,
   "actor": "Celeste",
   "expression": 3,
   "expressionName": "Sad",
   "text": "This industry was built on delusion. So many believe they can stand at the top, but only one can truly hold it. And that burden?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1761970052": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -2114862856,
   "actor": "Celeste",
   "expression": 2,
   "expressionName": "Angry",
   "text": "It isn’t yours. Or hers.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1412089506": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -2114862856,
   "actor": "Celeste",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "You can rise, you can fight—but in the end, you’ll remain exactly where you’re meant to be.",
   "jump": {
    "mode": "Jump",
